OL,13,Fweather. A few light showers across
OL,14,Fthe north and west.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,17,Fcloudy with more showers on Sunday. A
OL,18,Fdry start to Monday then rain
OL,19,Fspreading east. Showers or longer
OL,20,Fspells of rain on Tuesday.
